# Normalise line endings to LF, in the repository and in the working copy on
# every platform. This repo is cloned across Windows and macOS machines, and
# its Python files are pushed verbatim onto a MicroPython board -- letting Git
# rewrite them to CRLF on one platform and back on another produces diffs that
# are pure noise.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bin binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
